IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUBTRACT-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-A              PIC 9(4) VALUE 100.
       01  WS-B              PIC 9(4) VALUE 25.
       01  WS-RESULT         PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-TEMP           PIC 9(4) VALUE 50.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "SUBTRACT DEMO STARTED".

           DISPLAY "WS-A=" WS-A.
           DISPLAY "WS-B=" WS-B.

           SUBTRACT WS-B FROM WS-A GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "SUBTRACT B FROM A GIVING RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           SUBTRACT 10 FROM WS-A.
           DISPLAY "SUBTRACT 10 FROM A (in-place) A=" WS-A.

           SUBTRACT WS-B FROM WS-TEMP GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "SUBTRACT B FROM TEMP GIVING RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           SUBTRACT WS-A WS-B FROM 200 GIVING WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY "SUBTRACT A B FROM 200 GIVING RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           STOP RUN.